OL,3,ANew Indian mega library rocked by
OL,4,Ascandal over 'AI-generated books'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Indian court has ordered an
OL,7,Finvestigation into allegations that a
OL,8,Fpublic library in the southern state of
OL,9,FTamil Nadu bought hundreds of books
OL,10,Fsuspected of being generated using AI.
OL,12,FThe controversy began after Tamil
OL,13,Fnovelist Perumal Murugan raised
OL,14,Fconcerns about books containing false
OL,15,Finformation and questionable authorship
OL,16,Fat a newly opened library in Coimbatore
OL,17,Fcity.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
