OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794457449
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ANew Indian mega library rocked by
OL,4,Ascandal over 'AI-generated books'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Madras High Court has ordered the
OL,7,Fstate's anti-corruption agency to
OL,8,Finvestigate the purchases and freeze
OL,9,Fbank accounts linked to a publisher
OL,10,Faccused of supplying the books.
OL,12,FThe state government has blamed the
OL,13,Fprevious Dravida Munnetra Kazhagam
OL,14,F(DMK) party-led administration for
OL,15,Fbuying the books. The DMK denies
OL,16,Fallegations.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
